    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Vertic Tree Works LLC is a Baton Rouge–area tree company run by Landon Leger and Cole Grantham — partners, fifty-fifty. We do tree trimming, removal, stump grinding, and storm response. That’s the work. We show up with equipment that matches the job, give you a clear price, and clean up when we’re done.</p>
    <p>We’re a new company, and we’re building it on purpose. No franchise script. No sales manager who never climbs. When you call <a href="{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, you’re talking to the people who own the work.</p>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
